direction_674 = location "[Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond" about "[Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond\nA scrupulous man who is responsible for the provisioning and management of all goods and materials used by Moradon’s mercenary squads." found "Folk Village" at 359 535 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Master, if you need  Middle Class Upgrade Scroll , then you should look for Osmond ^^"
    Topic "Where is he/she?" do
        Map direction_674

On offer
    Say "A Middle Class Upgrade Scroll??? Ah~ I heard that it is the scroll that upgrades the level of middle class weapons... Do you need that?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Say "Hm~ I have kept it somewhere in the supply storage before. I think I will have to look for it.  Since it is one of the supplies, I can not give it to you without Rage's permission..."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "If you want the Magic Scroll, you have to do something for me. See, I lost an Apple of Moradon, right? You get me a replacement, and I'll hand over the Magic Scroll. However, be sure to keep this a secret from Rage."

On in_progress
    Say "Please bring them to me before Rage finds out.. Sob."

On ready
    Say "Master, you have collected all the Apples of Moradon that Osmond requested."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Phew ~ You have brought them.. I thought you were never coming back."
